# vba/vi_div (id 434): / \ Mod ^ for numeric operands, routed from vi_bin with a = (13, 14),
# b = (15, 16), OP in word 48. Two phases on PC (word 7):
# PC 0: class of OP (19 /, 20 \, 21 Mod, 22 ^); ra, rb = ROUND half even (magic 3 2^51) for \ Mod;
#   errors: / by 0 -> 11 (0 / 0 -> 6), \ Mod operand outside Long -> 6, \ Mod by 0 -> 11.
#   Else calls fm_dv1 (267, plain quotient gate gQ = word 38) with x = word 14, m = word 16, or
#   fm_pw0 (268, T0 = 3 POWER) with A = (1, a), B = (1, b); link LR = 434, LP = 1.
#   Saves aP, bP, ra, rb, typI (both Integer rank) in words 49..53 (callees pass 40..63).
# PC 1: A = result (tag 1 number, 4 error). /: Double, error -> 6. ^: Double, 0 ^ 0 = 1,
#   error -> 5 if a <= 0 else 6. \ Mod: r0 = ROUND(q), R0 = ra - rb r0 (exact), sign fix to the
#   truncated quotient Q and remainder R with the sign of ra; Integer or Long by typI, range -> 6.
#   Result block write [rT, rP] at SP - 4, SP -= 2, IP += 2, next = vi_fetch 421; errors -> 423.
# Note: weights/vba/vi_div.md
